  <b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Ashur ki raat guzar gayi, aur gyaraa muharram agayi. Kaydi bani ale nabi. Ye dekh ke royi binte zehra (gar lut gaya hussain ka) x2 Zindaan raha islam</font></p>
